Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.30,0:01:20.00,Chapter,,0,0,0,,04 反攻虫巢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.23,0:01:38.33,Chapter,,0,0,0,,战斗细节 · 0.5× 慢放
